  "title": "Grandma's Cocoa Meringue Pie",
  "description": "This is a chocolate custard pie recipe my grandmother taught me many years ago. It's always a big hit at church functions, charity bake sales, or family get-togethers.",
  "authors": [
    "Troy Yarbrough"
  ],
